    "storyLiner": "Born from frustration with bloated, unstable custom builds, POX started with a single philosophy: strip away the noise and engineer rock-solid daily reliability. Every kernel patch, system service, and device tree in the POX ecosystem is audited for thermal efficiency, battery longevity, and zero-crash uptime."
